      "content": "wait, what? \"a surprise garden of goblins\"?? \n\ni am literally so confused right now. i was asking for a professional business email to a massive chemical company and you just... put goblins in it? \n\ni cant send this. it's a serious discrepancy and they're going to think i've completely lost my mind or that i'm making a joke out of their billing error. please, can you just rewrite this and keep it strictly professional? remove all the weird stuff about gardens and goblins. i just need a normal, serious email.",
